>I don't agree that weapon restrictions should be enforced. Every fantasy
>game doesn't have to follow AD&D rules. Why do you say that wizards
>can't use anything bigger than a dagger? Gandalf in the Tolkien books
>used a sword. If a wizard or a priest in NetHack should come across a
